WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.597 --> 00:00:05.682
[Music] Can take one Guinness World Record which&nbsp;
is obviously a massive achievement,

00:00:05.682 --> 00:00:08.650
but to take another nine that says something 
- you're not going&nbsp;away.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.874
And guess what - I'm not going away.

00:00:12.456 --> 00:00:16.546
I'm Terry "Turbo" Burrows 
- the fastest window cleaner in the&nbsp;world.

00:00:17.653 --> 00:00:21.791
When I found out there was a world record, 
I knew I wanted to break it.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.866
I had to work out&nbsp;the maths, the movements 
- the training it's going to need.

00:00:26.866 --> 00:00:30.560
I thought, "yeah I can do that. Bring it on!"

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.932
When I first started out my Uncle Alfie taught me 
how to use the squeegee an applicator

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:40.752
and they&nbsp;would start wetting up with the right end - with the applicator - and then switch it over and squeegeeing&nbsp;it off

00:00:40.752 --> 00:00:45.448
and I thought why not just wet it up 
and "ch ch ch ch" - and do that?

00:00:46.118 --> 00:00:49.220
Terry had a talent.
And he wondered where&nbsp;it might take him.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.534
Every day I get up about 7 30.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.406
I come down and make myself some coffees 
- probably&nbsp;about three or four.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.096
I do a bit of gaming

00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:01.316
and then my regime starts.

00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:03.716
Welcome to the training&nbsp;camp!

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.520
I got myself a window 
and fixed it on the back of the garden shed.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:12.090
And I was practicing&nbsp;away and what was hilarious about all this

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.492
was our neighbor mowing the lawn 
and be looking at&nbsp;me thinking

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:18.145
"Why is he cleaning that window

00:01:18.145 --> 00:01:19.648
over and over again

00:01:19.648 --> 00:01:21.684
but the window don't go through&nbsp;anywhere

00:01:21.684 --> 00:01:23.614
it doesn't see anything - what is he doing?!"

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.412
Terry entered his first competition aged 40.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.536
I&nbsp;remember my first major competition was in France.

00:01:31.593 --> 00:01:35.426
It was huge it was like an arena
for the window cleaning competition!

00:01:35.472 --> 00:01:37.331
I was absolutely bowled over

00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:40.245
and then all of a sudden this person comes up&nbsp;to me

00:01:40.245 --> 00:01:42.797
they're carrying the Union Jack for me, I thought

00:01:43.254 --> 00:01:45.258
"Oh my God. This is like the Olympics!

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.756
This&nbsp;is amazing!"

00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:50.051
In those eight to nine seconds 
you've got to be as fast as you can

00:01:50.051 --> 00:01:52.183
you've got five&nbsp;moves per window

00:01:52.183 --> 00:01:53.541
and wipe the seal clean.

00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:55.058
And you've got to keep all that together

00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:57.840
just in those&nbsp;few seconds - it's nuts.

00:01:58.139 --> 00:01:59.631
Terry took home the trophy

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.900
and the next one

00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:02.279
and the next one.

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:06.450
well actually, he won the next 15 competitions he entered,

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.996
and he's not giving up anytime soon.

00:02:09.304 --> 00:02:12.477
What you do is you&nbsp;start from the top here go down like this 

00:02:12.477 --> 00:02:15.738
and all the time your leg's moved over into position...

00:02:15.944 --> 00:02:16.870
and&nbsp;uh -

00:02:17.087 --> 00:02:18.899
that is basically it.

00:02:19.242 --> 00:02:22.079
Don't look at that bit, you musn't look at that bit. (laughs)

00:02:22.323 --> 00:02:23.729
It's my life's passion.

00:02:23.786 --> 00:02:26.538
You've got to be tunnel-visioned - which I have been

00:02:26.538 --> 00:02:28.877
- and not swayed one iota.

00:02:29.014 --> 00:02:31.436
I plan to go out the world

00:02:31.436 --> 00:02:33.815
as the&nbsp;fastest window cleaner on the planet.

00:02:33.815 --> 00:02:35.712
So if any aliens are up there...

00:02:35.712 --> 00:02:39.717
um, that'll be&nbsp;cool. You can come down and take me on!

00:02:39.877 --> 00:02:41.210
[Music] [Guitar strum]

00:02:41.313 --> 00:02:42.885
[Singing] Let me

00:02:42.885 --> 00:02:44.372
dip you in me bucket

00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:45.589
and give you a squeeze.

00:02:45.589 --> 00:02:47.217
Would you let me climb your ladder?

00:02:47.217 --> 00:02:48.378
Ooh - you're such a tease! 

00:02:48.378 --> 00:02:50.105
Let me swing you in me cradle

00:02:50.105 --> 00:02:51.433
I'm begging&nbsp;you, please!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.284
Let me dip you in me bucket of love!

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.945
I see you every day as you walk by

00:02:57.048 --> 00:03:00.030
I wonder if you notice me way up in the&nbsp;sky

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.802
all the fellas on the site... [Fades]

